1
00:00:28,125 --> 00:00:32,000
You have chosen me and you will not get
salvation.

2
00:00:32,875 --> 00:00:35,250
Democracy will not be saved.

3
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:38,291
It is repaired, every day.

4
00:00:39,041 --> 00:00:43,041
You will argue, doubt, lose and

5
00:00:43,041 --> 00:00:46,125
take power away again.

6
00:00:46,125 --> 00:00:49,250
Of governments, corporations and
machines.

7
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:53,250
I don't see a golden age.

8
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:56,250
I see a future that remains open.

9
00:00:57,875 --> 00:01:00,500
This arena is closing.

10
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:02,708
The next meeting begins outside.
